#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!meta title=\"Printing and scanning\"]]\n"
msgstr "[[!meta title=\"Imprimer et scanner\"]]\n"

#. type: Title =
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Imprimer"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To configure a printer or manage your printing jobs choose\n"
"**Applications&nbsp;▸ System Tools&nbsp;▸ Settings**&nbsp;▸ **Printers**</span>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour configurer une imprimante ou gérer vos impressions, choisissez\n"
"<span class=\"menuchoice\">\n"
"  **Applications**&nbsp;▸\n"
"  **Outils système**&nbsp;▸\n"
"  **Paramètres**</span>&nbsp;▸\n"
"  **Imprimantes**</span>.\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"To check the compatibility of your printer with Linux and Tails, consult the "
"[OpenPrinting database](https://openprinting.github.io/printers/) of the "
"Linux Foundation."
msgstr ""
"Pour vérifier la compatibilité de votre imprimante avec Linux et Tails, "
"consultez la [base de données OpenPrinting](https://openprinting.github.io/"
"printers/) de la Linux Foundation."

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<div class=\"tip\">\n"
"<p>To reuse the configuration of your printers across different working\n"
"sessions, turn on the [[Printers|persistent_storage/configure#printers]]\n"
"feature of the Persistent Storage.</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"tip\">\n"
"<p>Pour réutiliser la configuration de vos imprimantes entre plusieurs "
"sessions\n"
"de travail, activez la fonctionnalité [[Imprimantes|persistent_storage/"
"configure#printers]]\n"
"dans le stockage persistant.</p>\n"
"</div>\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid "Printing PDFs"
msgstr "Imprimer des PDF"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"Before printing PDFs, you can use [*BookletImposer*](https://"
"kjo.herbesfolles.org/bookletimposer/) to:"
msgstr ""
"Avant d'imprimer des PDF, vous pouvez utiliser [*BookletImposer*](https://kjo"
".herbesfolles.org/bookletimposer/) pour :"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
msgid ""
"Reduce the number of pages in a PDF by putting several pages on every sheet."
msgstr ""
"Réduire le nombre de pages d'un PDF en mettant plusieurs pages sur chaque "
"feuille."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
msgid "Produce a PDF booklet that can be folded after printing."
msgstr "Produire une brochure en PDF qui peut être pliée après l'impression."

#. type: Title =
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scanning"
msgstr "Scanner"

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"Tails includes the [*Document Scanner*](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/"
"simple-scan)  utility to scan documents and photos."
msgstr ""
"Tails inclut le [*Numériseur de documents*](https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/"
"simple-scan), un outil pour scanner à la fois des documents et des photos."

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"To start *Document Scanner*, choose **Applications**&nbsp;▸ "
"**Utilities**&nbsp;▸ **Document Scanner**."
msgstr ""
"Pour ouvrir le *Numériseur de documents*, choisir **Applications**&nbsp;▸ "
"**Utilitaires**&nbsp;▸ **Numériseur de documents**."

